    "content": "<div class=\"gform-instructions\">\n  <h2>How to Complete This Timesheet</h2>\n  <p>This timesheet tracks all direct care services you provide throughout the month. Each row represents one service entry (a visit or shift with a client).</p>\n\n  <details open>\n    <summary><strong>Step 1: Enter Your Information</strong></summary>\n    <ol>\n      <li><strong>DSP Name:</strong> Enter your full name as the Direct Support Professional or provider.</li>\n      <li><strong>Month of:</strong> Enter the month and year you are reporting (e.g., \"December 2025\").</li>\n    </ol>\n  </details>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary><strong>Step 2: Track Daily Service Entries</strong></summary>\n    <p>Use the interactive timesheet grid below to record each service entry. For each row, enter:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Date:</strong> The date of service (day of month, 1-31)</li>\n      <li><strong>Client Initials:</strong> The initials of the client you served</li>\n      <li><strong>Service Type:</strong> Type of service provided (e.g., \"PRS\", \"DSP\", \"SCC\", \"MSP\")</li>\n      <li><strong>Time In:</strong> When you started service (e.g., \"9:00 AM\")</li>\n      <li><strong>Time Out:</strong> When you ended service (e.g., \"2:00 PM\")</li>\n      <li><strong>Total Hours:</strong> This will auto-calculate based on Time In and Time Out</li>\n      <li><strong># of Trips:</strong> Number of transportation trips provided (if applicable)</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p><strong>Tips:</strong></p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Use the <strong>+ Add Row</strong> button to add more service entries</li>\n      <li>Click <strong>- Delete</strong> to remove a row</li>\n      <li>Your entries are saved automatically as you work</li>\n      <li>Hours will calculate automatically when you enter Time In and Time Out</li>\n      <li>The <strong>Total Direct Care Hours</strong> will update automatically at the bottom</li>\n    </ul>\n  </details>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary><strong>Step 3: Review Totals</strong></summary>\n    <p>Before submitting:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Check that all service dates are accurate</li>\n      <li>Verify client initials are correct</li>\n      <li>Confirm time entries are accurate</li>\n      <li>Review the <strong>Total Direct Care Hours</strong> at the bottom</li>\n      <li>Ensure all transportation trips are recorded</li>\n    </ul>\n  </details>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary><strong>Step 4: Sign and Submit</strong></summary>\n    <ol>\n      <li><strong>DSP Signature:</strong> Enter your name to certify this timesheet</li>\n      <li><strong>Date:</strong> Select today's date</li>\n      <li>Click <strong>Submit Timesheet</strong> to finalize</li>\n    </ol>\n    <p style=\"background:#fff8dc;padding:10px;border-left:4px solid #ff9800;margin-top:10px\">\n      <strong>⚠️ Important:</strong> This timesheet is <strong>DUE TO REAL CARE, INC. BY THE 22nd OF EACH MONTH</strong>\n    </p>\n  </details>\n</div>",
